SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 48 - Services in half a Mile.
 Completion Date Slightly Further
DESCRIPTION:The service area project continues, and we're getting ever
 closer to finally opening the doors. The signs may promise services in
 half a mile, but they make absolutely no guarantees about when those
 services will actually exist. Still, at least the construction equipment
 is getting plenty of exercise. Construction Simulator is back - bigger and
 better than ever! Take charge of over 70 machines, dozens of them brand
 new to the franchise, and build to your heart's content on two huge maps -
 on your own or with your friends!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=esqehetLCRg
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24812211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260922T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T173400Z
DTSTART:20261013T203000Z
DTEND:20261013T223000Z
SUMMARY:Lotwick Hill | Ep. 1 - Good Morning, Lotwick Hill! Your Money Is
 Safe With Me. Mostly.
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new series begins as we head into Lotwick Hill! We're
 starting our adventure with the sort of reassuring financial promise that
 should immediately make everyone nervous. Come along for our first look at
 the game and discover whether trusting me with the money is a brilliant
 idea or an administrative disaster waiting to happen. It's time to start
 small and dream big as we build our very own business empire in the living
 harbour city of Lotwick Hill! Starting in the 1930s, we'll buy property,
 open shops, choose what to sell, set our prices and compete with rival
 businesses for customers. As the decades pass, we can expand into new
 shops, apartments and hotels while adapting to changing products and
 customer tastes. With property auctions, resource management, changing
 weather and a full day-and-night cycle, let's see if we can turn our first
 little shop into an empire that lasts all the way into the modern day.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PqNfNFf7e1U
CATEGORIES:Lotwick Hill
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24822211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260923T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T173400Z
DTSTART:20261014T203000Z
DTEND:20261014T223000Z
SUMMARY:Velvet Assassin | Ep. 1 - Nothing Suspicious Here, Just Another
 Guard Gone Missing
DESCRIPTION:Another brand-new series arrives as we step into the shadows
 of Velvet Assassin. Tonight we're attempting stealth, patience, and
 carefully planned movements through dangerous wartime environments.
 Naturally, there's every chance my definition of stealth will involve
 someone discovering an unconscious guard approximately three seconds after
 I've declared the coast clear. Step into the shadows of World War II as
 British secret agent Violette Summer in this dark and atmospheric stealth
 adventure inspired by the story of real-life agent Violette Szabo. Deep
 behind enemy lines, we'll infiltrate heavily guarded locations, sabotage
 enemy operations and use darkness to remain unseen while silently dealing
 with anyone standing in our way. With missions unfolding through
 Violette's feverish memories from a hospital bed, surreal environments and
 a strong focus on stealth, patience and timing, we'll see if we have what
 it takes to survive some extremely dangerous assignments.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KSPF5MdU5m4
CATEGORIES:Velvet Assassin
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24832211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260924T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T173400Z
DTSTART:20261015T180000Z
DTEND:20261015T203000Z
SUMMARY:A Christmas Party Before Halloween with Jade the Chocolate Thief
DESCRIPTION:Forget the calendar - we're getting festive early! We are out
 with Jade the Chocolate Thief for a special Christmas party before we've
 even reached Halloween. Expect seasonal silliness, plenty of laughs, and a
 wonderfully confused celebration that proves it's never too early to start
 causing festive chaos. Just keep an eye on the chocolate. Who says we have
 to wait until December to celebrate Christmas? Tonight, I'm taking a night
 off from streaming and heading out for a Christmas party... before
 Halloween has even arrived! Joining me for this slightly premature festive
 celebration is none other than Jade the Chocolate Thief! Expect plenty of
 laughs, festive cheer, good company and probably a little bit of chaos as
 we swap gaming for a night out. Will Jade manage to resist stealing all
 the Christmas chocolates? Somehow, I doubt it! There won't be a live
 stream tonight, but sometimes even Dr Ravenholm needs to step away from
 the games and enjoy a little festive fun!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=
CATEGORIES:Christmas Party Before Halloween with Jade the Chocolate Thief
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
